    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f08243dd76ebf6c3859ea422",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "所以……拜托您。\n遇到困难的时候——请试着依赖一下其他人。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd6c230102f18ac23c4f1eb25175959925747a65ee9c3024eff200acc62513c3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
