    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21567f10616370abdb2eed09",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "如果当初只有我一个人硬撑，\n肯定无法举办一场\n令人满意的送别会吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "46c33cc4cfa3043c165c95702507b135955c0668020c67f97d67ae39d9cb6fdb",
